  "published": "2026-04-25T07:48:43.827Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.0 stable: Version-sync with SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.0. No source changes in WebTorrent.Server itself. WebTorrent 3.2.0 bundles four additive features on top of 3.1.8: (1) `WebTorrentClientOptions.AdvertiseTcpListenerToTrackers` so HTTP/UDP tracker announces include the listener's port (mainline peers find us automatically via the tracker, no manual addPeers); (2) pluggable `IPieceHashEngine` for future GPU-batched piece verification; (3) `BandwidthPolicy` enum (Unlimited/Conservative/Metered/SeedingDisabled/Custom) + `WebTorrentClient.ApplyBandwidthPolicy` runtime knob; (4) full `Docs/tcp-listener.md` covering TcpListener + tracker advertising + port-forwarding/NAT setup. SipSorcery fork: `MediaStreamTrack.StreamStatus` setter widened from internal to public. Zero behavior change for consumers who don't opt in. See SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.0 release notes.",
